  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 38,
      "sourceIndex": 1052
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "main idea / mainly about / best summary。",
      "sourcePage": 38,
      "sourceIndex": 1053
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 38,
      "sourceIndex": 1054
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Main idea：整篇或一段最核心的信息。",
      "sourcePage": 38,
      "sourceIndex": 1055
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “找每段共同围绕的核心，不要被某个精彩细节吸走。”",
      "sourcePage": 38,
      "sourceIndex": 1056
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 主旨题考信息层级：细节 < 分论点 < 总主题。",
      "sourcePage": 38,
      "sourceIndex": 1057
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 38,
      "sourceIndex": 1058
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 快速看首段主题入口。",
      "sourcePage": 38,
      "sourceIndex": 1059
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 给每段用3-6个字写“小标签”。",
      "sourcePage": 38,
      "sourceIndex": 1060
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 找这些标签共同指向什么。",
      "sourcePage": 38,
      "sourceIndex": 1061
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 比较选项范围：太窄、太大、跑题都删。",
      "sourcePage": 38,
      "sourceIndex": 1062
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 圈题干人物/时间/地点/段落/核心名词/NOT；定位后在段边写题号；必要时写",
      "sourcePage": 39,
      "sourceIndex": 1063
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“证据→选项”。",
      "sourcePage": 39,
      "sourceIndex": 1064
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 39,
      "sourceIndex": 1065
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 故事类 → 主旨常是人物经历/变化，不是单一事件",
      "sourcePage": 39,
      "sourceIndex": 1066
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 说明文 → 看解释对象+核心发现/作用",
      "sourcePage": 39,
      "sourceIndex": 1067
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 议论/观点文 → 看中心主张+主要理由",
      "sourcePage": 39,
      "sourceIndex": 1068
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 选项能覆盖多数段落，又不无限泛化。",
      "sourcePage": 39,
      "sourceIndex": 1069
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 如果不会概括全文，先回答“作者为什么要把这几段放在一起？”",
      "sourcePage": 39,
      "sourceIndex": 1070
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 39,
      "sourceIndex": 1071
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "四段分别写社区花园的建立、参与、健康效果和扩展计划。主旨应是社区花园及其影响，而不是“健康饮",
      "sourcePage": 39,
      "sourceIndex": 1072
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "食”一个细节。",
      "sourcePage": 39,
      "sourceIndex": 1073
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 39,
      "sourceIndex": 1074
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 选择最有哲理的选项。",
      "sourcePage": 39,
      "sourceIndex": 1075
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 范围太窄/太大。",
      "sourcePage": 39,
      "sourceIndex": 1076
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 39,
      "sourceIndex": 1077
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 能覆盖每段吗？",
      "sourcePage": 39,
      "sourceIndex": 1078
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 有没有超出文章范围？",
      "sourcePage": 39,
      "sourceIndex": 1079
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： R-L 定位错｜R-P 同义替换错｜R-I 过度推",
      "sourcePage": 39,
      "sourceIndex": 1080
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "断｜R-S 范围/程度偷换｜R-N NOT/EXCEPT漏看｜R-M 主旨范围错。",
      "sourcePage": 39,
      "sourceIndex": 1081
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 39,
      "sourceIndex": 1082
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 主旨 = 每段共同围着转的东西。",
      "sourcePage": 39,
      "sourceIndex": 1083
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 39,
      "sourceIndex": 1085
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. 主旨题最怕什么？",
      "sourcePage": 39,
      "sourceIndex": 1086
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. 给每段贴1-3词标签的作用？",
      "sourcePage": 39,
      "sourceIndex": 1087
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 选项只覆盖一段通常？",
      "sourcePage": 39,
      "sourceIndex": 1088
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 选项“education in human history”而文章只讲一所学校改革，问题？",
      "sourcePage": 39,
      "sourceIndex": 1089
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 主旨正确答案应覆盖？",
      "sourcePage": 39,
      "sourceIndex": 1090
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 被某个具体细节吸走。；2. 找共同核心。；3. 太窄。；4. 范围过大。；5. 文章大部分段落和作者核心",
      "sourcePage": 40,
      "sourceIndex": 1091
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "话题。",
      "sourcePage": 40,
      "sourceIndex": 1092
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— R10 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“R10”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 40,
      "sourceIndex": 1093
    }
